  "source_code": "# cook your dish here\r\nt=int(input())\r\nfor k in range(t):\r\n    n =int(input())\r\n    a=list(map(int,input().split()))\r\n    a.sort(reverse=True)\r\n    m=3*n\r\n    pre=[0]*(m+1)\r\n    for i in range(m):\r\n        pre[i+1]=pre[i]+a[i]\r\n    ans=0\r\n    for i in range(n+1):\r\n        maxb=n-i\r\n        lo=0\r\n        hi=maxb\r\n        while lo<hi:\r\n            mid=(lo+hi)//2\r\n            d=(a[i+2*mid]+a[i+2*mid+1]-3*a[m-2*i-mid-1])\r\n            if d>=0:\r\n                lo=mid+1\r\n            else:\r\n                hi=mid\r\n        for b in(lo,lo-1,maxb):\r\n            if 0<=b<=maxb:\r\n                value=(2*pre[i]+pre[i+2*b]+3*pre[m-2*i-b])\r\n                ans=max(ans,value)\r\n    print(ans)\r\n            ",
